                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Frontend Developer</h1>
            <p>Building beautiful and functional web experiences with modern technologies.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about">
        <div class="about-content">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
